Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:39.31,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:51.11,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,What was that blood he spat out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:53.11,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:55.00,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:56.57,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.27,0:00:59.47,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,That's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:04.53,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Straw Doll Technique:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.08,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Resonance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:26.76,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,How many of them are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:30.40,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,We should just keep going \Nlike it's whack-a-mole, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:31.27,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:32.69,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.69,0:01:34.85,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Keep exorcising them for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.85,0:01:36.78,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,We'll crush every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:39.00,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It likely won't retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.89,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You mean its main body \Ndoesn't have much offense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:46.68,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,since its technique covers a \Nwide area, even limited as it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:48.98,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only saying it's likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:52.55,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,All the things we were worried about—\Nits technique's range,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:54.53,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,the number of victims, the barrier—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.97,0:01:57.87,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,All of those are subtracting \Nfrom its main body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:01:59.50,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,We're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:02.89,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be able to exorcise it quickly, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:07.68,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Which means... the real \Nproblem comes afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.40,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:19.36,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:22.61,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You just whack the mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.22,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.78,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,She gets sucked away so often!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.96,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,But what was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.13,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The mole?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:35.44,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That earlier one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:38.06,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:40.31,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:43.47,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, hey, it's my older brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.90,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:51.77,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,It fled?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:53.35,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Should I let it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:54.77,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Chase after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:58.78,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki and that thing both \Nwent outside the barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.79,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,She might be battling against something \Nmore troublesome than we expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:05.25,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,In contrast, things are far \Neasier here than anticipated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:06.77,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I can handle this by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.29,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Prioritize Kugisaki! Go after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:11.69,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,If things get bad in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:14.64,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,then you come out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:24.39,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:25.68,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:34.32,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,You're a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:37.65,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,Well, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:43.44,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,We brothers were tasked with an errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:49.20,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,But killing jujutsu sorcerers \Nisn't part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.66,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,If you withdraw, we'll let you escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.67,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:57.17,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,An errand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:01.16,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,Hm? I presumed you were \Non the same errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:03.57,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,A cursed spirit? A curse user?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:05.17,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Which is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:07.17,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,And what is that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:22.49,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:28.49,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Your sneak attack's too simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:35.23,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, it's too simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.67,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Did I exorcise them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.70,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That takes care of Tsumiki for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.22,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Now to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:01.01,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,One survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.67,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't its main body just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:06.01,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The barrier hasn't collapsed, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:07.01,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:15.86,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't try too hard to find logic \Nin a cursed spirit's behavioral patterns,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:19.66,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but that fact had been \Nnagging me this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:27.02,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Why did it just start killing \Nhumans it had marked now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.76,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The first one was killed in June.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.56,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,And in June...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:41.01,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,Our objective here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:44.49,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,is to retrieve Sukuna's finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:10.81,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1398,1)\c&H0F0D09&\3c&HB7BD80&\t(1236,1817,1 \3c&H85A2A4&)\t(1819,2945,1 \3c&H95DED9&)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:26.37,Ep_Title_Shadow,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(613,520)\pos(612,310)}Episode 23: {\fs26\fscx80}The Origin of Blind Obedience - 2 -
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.29,0:07:26.37,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(613,520)\pos(612,310)}Episode 23: {\fs26\fscx80}The Origin of Blind Obedience - 2 -
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.48,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Some have a presence \Nthat's too overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.03,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Some keep very quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:27.33,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Some have already been \Nabsorbed by a cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:30.29,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This is resonance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.44,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sukuna's finger kept its power repressed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:36.21,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,within the cursed spirit \Nthat had absorbed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:37.78,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but back in June,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.21,0:07:41.72,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,when Sukuna manifested in Itadori, \Nit released its cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:45.11,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It looks the same
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:49.82,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,as the one from the juvenile detention center, \Nbut it's probably several degrees...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:57.40,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:08.63,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Nue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:17.20,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I win again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:20.41,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,This is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.85,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,You rarely ask me to train you, Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:25.65,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Are you in a rush after Yuji surpassed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:29.76,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Well, beggars can't be choosers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.27,0:08:33.28,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,It bothers you that much to rely on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:35.73,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Megumi, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:40.29,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,I think you have just as much ability \Nand potential as Yuji does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:43.67,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,The problem is just your mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:45.29,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Megumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:48.09,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,you don't know how to \Nbring out your best, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.29,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:53.41,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Are you saying I haven't \Nbeen giving it my best?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:56.38,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not saying you haven't.\NI'm saying you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:59.10,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,For example, in the baseball game the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.76,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you go for a sacrifice bunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:07.94,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Did you want Nobara to advance the bases,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:09.93,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,even if it meant you'd be out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.81,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,That's a splendid attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:16.06,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,but Yuji and I would \Nalways go for a home run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:21.61,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not saying a bunt is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:23.62,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Baseball is a team sport,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:25.91,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,and everyone has their role to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:28.66,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,But jujutsu sorcery is an individual sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.71,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Coordinating with other sorcerers \Nis important, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:33.63,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:37.03,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,But no matter how many \Nallies you have around you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:40.05,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,when you die, you'll be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:45.27,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,You can only piece together \Nundervalued data on yourself and others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:50.43,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,You can't imagine a stronger \Nfuture version of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:52.88,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe that's because of your trump card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.43,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,You believe that in the worst case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:57.59,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,you can resolve everything \Nat the cost of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.12,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,But at that point, forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.75,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,You'll never even measure up to Nanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:07.06,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Dying to win and risking death to win...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:14.06,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,are completely different, Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:16.87,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Give it your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:19.00,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Be greedier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:30.88,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,How many seconds was I unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:33.79,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,My Demon Dog's destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:36.48,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,no, the technique was released.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:43.96,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This is it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:50.08,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sacred treasure, swing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:58.17,Flashback,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,What a waste of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:03.40,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.16,Flashback_Italics,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,A jujutsu sorcerer's growth curve
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:10.30,Flashback_Italics,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,isn't necessarily a gentle slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:15.26,Flashback,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, why did you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.37,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Spit out the entire depths of my shadow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:23.05,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Worry about a specific structure later,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:27.38,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,and just push it out as soon \Nas I collect the cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:33.25,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Imagine a future version of myself \Nwho's freely surpassed my limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:35.45,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:37.41,Flashback_Italics,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,With a strong foundation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:40.33,Flashback_Italics,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,and a little bit of sense and imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:44.26,Flashback_Italics,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,it just takes the slightest trigger \Nto change a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:47.80,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Domain Expansion:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:55.35,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Chimera Shadow Garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:11:59.72,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's incomplete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:02.21,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's ugly work at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:05.03,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,But for now, that's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.72,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Broaden it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.15,0:12:26.76,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,more freely!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.01,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The interpretation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.56,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,of the technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:04.96,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Demon Dog Totality's claws \Nwere able to injure that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:11.43,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They'd have no trouble piercing through \Nyou when you're caught off-guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:24.98,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:31.60,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Now, where are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:35.87,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.76,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:56.93,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:01.94,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:07.68,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,There's one fundamental rule \Nfor interacting with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:10.14,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.82,Flashback,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:15.42,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's "I won't kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:18.78,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,so please don't kill me, either."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:21.34,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You can substitute "kill" \Nfor anything you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:25.51,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The point is drawing a line where you agree \Nnot to infringe on the other person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:28.04,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,In order for both people to exist together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:29.40,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,they need that rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.83,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Breaking that rule, swaggering about,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:33.97,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,and having others trying not to anger you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:37.22,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,must have felt real pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:41.94,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Next time you do it in \Nfront of me, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.10,Flashback,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,What did we ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.22,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Figure it out yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:48.61,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,or go die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.61,0:14:49.60,Flashback,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:54.12,Flashback,Aida,0000,0000,0000,,T-T-T-T-Today's the day I tell \Noff Ikezawa and his buddies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:57.24,Flashback,Aida,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not their gofer anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.94,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it, Aida-shi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:02.00,Flashback,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,But I might become their next target,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:04.12,Flashback,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,so don't try too hard, Aida-shi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:06.08,Flashback,Aida,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come on, fatty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:07.51,Flashback,Aida,0000,0000,0000,,I'm changing the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:10.84,Flashback,Aida,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell them this fatty is my \Nreplacement starting today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:12.75,Flashback,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,You'd sell your friend out, Aida-shi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.08,Flashback,Aida,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.99,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:20.28,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:23.01,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that Ikezawa and his \Nbuddies piled up over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:26.09,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,You said you wouldn't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:29.02,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't act like you're my guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:32.52,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I hate bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:38.78,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They act so damn superior when \Ntheir empathy and imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:41.14,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,are as empty as a vacant lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:43.76,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I can't deal with good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:46.97,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They forgive those bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:51.02,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Then they view the act of \Nforgiveness as a noble thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:54.81,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Makes me want to vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:58.36,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Tsumiki's a model example of a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:01.51,Flashback,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You disgust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.46,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:09.19,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think it'd spill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.27,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,When I was in first grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.04,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,my father and Tsumiki's mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.49,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,one parent each, hooked up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:21.19,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,and then vanished without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:25.63,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,A suspicious white-haired man told us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:27.46,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,You know, your dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:31.12,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,He's from the Zen'in Clan, \Na big clan among jujutsu sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:33.98,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,but they're such good-for-nothings, \Nit freaks even me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:36.58,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Your father left the clan to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:39.14,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Megumi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:44.55,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,your father was saving you as the ultimate \Ncard to use against the Zen'in clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:46.74,Flashback,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Pisses you off, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:50.65,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That solved the mystery of how \Nthey got the funds to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:53.65,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, I had been sold \Nto that Zen'in clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.33,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.86,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Especially your lack of tact about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:04.16,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, that irritating man stopped \Nmy sale to the Zen'in clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.42,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,and used the promise that I would work \Nas a jujutsu sorcerer as collateral
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:12.71,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,to get financial aid from \NJujutsu High to support us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.12,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What's this jujutsu sorcerer crap, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:18.28,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:21.41,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Who the hell would I ever save?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:22.68,Flashback,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Tsumiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.48,Flashback,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.11,Flashback,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Megumi-kun, ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.64,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:28.77,Flashback,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:32.15,Flashback,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,So did you give any thought \Nto the test of courage?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:35.04,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to go, but I'll go \Nbecause I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.69,0:17:37.87,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Shortly after I started ninth grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:39.96,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Tsumiki was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:42.98,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The identity was unknown.\NThe origin was unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:46.17,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,But apparently there were several \Nvictims of the same curse nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:50.33,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,All I found out was that \Nnobody knew anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:52.52,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,and Tsumiki was left bedridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:56.08,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,If I have the time to curse someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:17:58.63,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather spend it thinking \Nabout those precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:01.53,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,She always smiled and spouted pretty ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:05.36,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,Not forgiving people isn't a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.56,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,That's just part of your kindness, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:10.90,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,She even accepted my disposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:17.05,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Yet Tsumiki would get genuinely \Nangry whenever I hurt someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.97,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That irritated me because
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.57,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it was hypocritical in light \Nof her leave-others-be policy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:28.90,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but now I realize I had the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:32.66,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Just as I choose who I save,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:35.20,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,she was choosing me to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:37.29,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:39.02,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I was just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:40.92,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'll apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:45.36,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,So wake up already, stupid sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:49.99,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, my head hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:54.52,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This Yasohachi Bridge curse \Nwas just overlapping the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:59.15,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt the curse that put Tsumiki \Ninto a coma was undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:05.96,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Now, how do I break the news \Nabout the finger... to... Itadori...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:11.95,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\shad0\bord2\an2\pos(548,320)}m 0 0 l 0 -150 l 98 -150 l 96 0
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.95,0:19:11.95,sign_30331_274_Fushiguro_Fell_A,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(548,96)\fscx95\fscy120}Fushiguro\NFell\NAsleep
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.89,Italics,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,A huge presence suddenly appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:19.46,Italics,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,Did Sukuna's finger leave the barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:24.30,Italics,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,If a sorcerer exorcised the finger's host,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:26.96,Italics,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,they're quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.40,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,But even if the finger's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:32.54,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Even if the special-grade \Ncursed spirit was defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.41,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,they wouldn't come out unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.46,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I hope they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:41.19,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,I misspoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:44.56,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,Please forget what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.05,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:49.16,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,He's going after the finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:51.96,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You think you can mock me \Nby running like that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.64,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,and still get away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:58.47,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a bit insecure about my back, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:00.00,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,This is your warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:03.01,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,If you see my back, I'll kill—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:04.13,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kugisaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:06.01,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:13.38,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Y-Y-You saw, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:14.63,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:14.93,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:15.92,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.93,0:20:15.70,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.19,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:20.68,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:28.02,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Then why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:29.86,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Is that the source of this weird smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:31.54,Main,Eso,0000,0000,0000,,Because it gets musty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:36.29,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Rot Technique, Supreme Art: Wing King!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.05,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:44.59,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,by Wasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.93,0:22:17.44,sign_32727_342_Juju_Stroll,All&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Juju Stroll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:20.75,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:23.77,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.83,0:22:23.77,Main,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:26.14,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,So annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:28.75,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,It's too hot for your craziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:31.03,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Fushiguro's getting hit on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.63,0:22:34.10,Main,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Formation B!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:35.33,Main,All,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:39.53,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Fushiguro-kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:41.11,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that woman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.11,0:22:43.66,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Have you forgotten the night \Nyou toasted to my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:47.91,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Was it all a lie when you said your time \Nwith me was the most enjoyable of all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:49.21,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That night! That night!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.35,0:22:49.55,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.55,0:22:50.82,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.73,Main,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Could you not touch him so casually, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:56.31,Main,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,you homewreckers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.69,0:23:02.26,Main,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Megumi-chan has violin practice with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:05.33,Main,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home, Megumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.33,0:23:08.99,Main,Gojo,0000,0000,0000,,Today I'll have you master \N"Twinkle Twinkle Little Star."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:10.47,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.47,0:23:12.10,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't mind them. Just go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:13.76,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The station's straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.45,Main,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:16.31,Main,All,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.09,0:23:19.01,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, seriously, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:22.13,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Could you stop? You're embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:26.88,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:29.88,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.43,0:23:39.89,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1029,1)}Episode 24:\NComplicity
